{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Manage reactive state in your TUIkit application."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit provides a state management system modeled after SwiftUI. When state changes, the view tree is automatically re-rendered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"@State","anchor":"State","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for simple values owned by a single view:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct CounterView: View {","    @State var count = 0","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            Text(\"Count: \\(count)\")","            Button(\"Increment\") {","                count += 1  \/\/ Triggers re-render","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Binding","anchor":"Binding","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Binding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides a two-way connection to a value owned elsewhere. Use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"$","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" prefix on a ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property to get its binding:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct ParentView: View {","    @State var selectedIndex = 0","","    var body: some View {","        Menu(items: menuItems, selection: $selectedIndex)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create constant bindings for previews or static values:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let binding = Binding.constant(42)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"@Environment","anchor":"Environment","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EnvironmentValues"},{"type":"text","text":" provides values propagated down